<title>SINGAPORE: Labroy 1996 net profit up 18.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Labroy 1996 net profit up 18.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     11.77 vs  9.94</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    5.00 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     6.53 vs  5.68</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   5.74 vs  5.68</p>
<p>    Turnover				 81.17 vs 59.40</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 1.20 vs  1.28</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    1.73 vs  1.30</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	   9.20 vs  6.91</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 13.11 vs 11.24</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.18 vs  1.03</p>
<p>    Minorities (losses)		   0.15 vs  0.28</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:		    June 18, 1997</p>
<p>    Last day books open:		  July 8, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Labroy Marine Ltd is involved in the shipping industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
